### Change a billing account status (replace the patient id)
# Allowed: ACTIVE <-> SUSPENDED, ACTIVE -> CLOSED, SUSPENDED -> CLOSED. CLOSED is final (409).
PATCH http://localhost:4004/api/billing-accounts/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "SUSPENDED"
}
